#: Bazaar/Pontikka/Arvo Kirkastaja
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.57.53.text"
msgid "We ordered them from a company called...\\,\\, Närpestech, I think."
msgstr "Encomendamos de uma empresa chamada...\\,\\, Närpestech, acho."

#: Bazaar/Pontikka/Arvo Kirkastaja
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.57.54.text"
msgid "The equipment was very expensive\\, and took ages to arrive\\,\\,, but they're worth every penny."
msgstr "O equipamento foi caríssimo\\, e demorou uma eternidade para chegar\\,\\,, mas vale cada centavo."

#: Bazaar/Pontikka/Arvo Kirkastaja
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.57.55.text"
msgid "If you're interested\\,\\,, I could order some for you.\\,\\,\\, The more advanced hydroponics shelves were north of 10K RM.\\,\\,\\, Vertical farms are cheaper.\\,\\, Around 2K to 3K."
msgstr "Se tiver interesse\\,\\,, posso encomendar alguns para você.\\,\\,\\, As estantes hidropônicas mais avançadas passavam de 10 mil RM.\\,\\,\\, As fazendas verticais são mais baratas.\\,\\, Uns 2 a 3 mil."

#: Bazaar/Pontikka/Arvo Kirkastaja
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.57.56.text"
msgid "I'll get the exact quote,\\, if you're interested."
msgstr "Eu consigo o orçamento exato,\\, se tiver interesse."

#: Bazaar/Pontikka/Arvo Kirkastaja
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.57.57.text"
msgid "(Leave)"
msgstr "(Sair)"

#: Bazaar/Pontikka/Arvo Kirkastaja
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.57.58.text"
