#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.1.text"
msgid "Hejsan!\\,\\,\\, Looking to\\, buy some\\, soft\\, and tasty\\, artisan bread?\\,\\,\\, Finest in\\, Obenseuer!"
msgstr "Hejsan!\\,\\,\\, Quer\\, comprar um\\, pão artesanal\\, macio\\, e gostoso?\\,\\,\\, O melhor de\\, Obenseuer!"

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.2.text"
msgid "Yes, please! (Buy) "
msgstr "Sim, por favor! (Comprar) "

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.3.text"
msgid "Even bread made from cement would be softer!"
msgstr "Até pão de cimento seria mais macio!"

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.4.text"
msgid "Oi!\\,\\,\\, Did you\\, know that\\, Mesoamerican people\\, used to\\, boil corn in\\, cement to\\, improve its\\, nutritional value\\,\\,, taste\\,\\,, and to\\, enable making\\, corn dough?\\,\\,\\, They call it\\, 'nixtamalization'."
msgstr "Oi!\\,\\,\\, Você\\, sabia que\\, os povos mesoamericanos\\, cozinhavam milho\\, no cimento para\\, melhorar seu\\, valor nutritivo\\,\\,, o sabor\\,\\,, e para\\, conseguir fazer\\, massa de milho?\\,\\,\\, Chamam isso\\, de “nixtamalização”."

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.5.text"
msgid "(Leave)"
msgstr "(Sair)"

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.6.text"
msgid ".\\,.\\,.\\, Or was it\\, lime\\, that they used?\\,\\,\\, But\\, anyway\\,\\,, not that I'm\\, boiling my\\, flour in\\, cement or\\, lime!\\,\\,\\, That\\, interesting fact just\\, came to my mind\\, from your comment."
msgstr ".\\,.\\,.\\, Ou era\\, cal\\, que eles usavam?\\,\\,\\, Mas\\, enfim\\,\\,, não que eu\\, cozinhe minha\\, farinha no\\, cimento ou\\, na cal!\\,\\,\\, Essa\\, curiosidade só\\, me veio à cabeça\\, por causa do seu comentário."

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.7.text"
msgid "You should\\, really try it!\\,\\,\\, I mean...\\,\\, my\\, bread\\,\\,, not\\, boiling in\\, cement.\\,\\,\\, But\\, of course\\,\\,, you can\\, try that too."
msgstr "Você devia\\, mesmo experimentar!\\,\\,\\, Quer dizer...\\,\\, o meu\\, pão\\,\\,, não\\, cozinhar no\\, cimento.\\,\\,\\, Mas\\, claro\\,\\,, você\\, pode experimentar isso também."

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.8.text"
msgid "You got any more interesting baking facts?"
msgstr "Tem mais alguma curiosidade de padaria?"

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.9.text"
msgid "Yes!\\,\\,\\, Did you know\\, that you can\\, substitute\\, a small amount of\\, finely ground sawdust\\,\\, into\\, dough\\, before people can even notice?"
msgstr "Tenho!\\,\\,\\, Você sabia\\, que dá para\\, substituir\\, uma pequena quantidade de\\, serragem bem moída\\,\\, na\\, massa\\, sem ninguém nem perceber?"

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.10.text"
msgid "Umm...\\,\\,\\, not that my\\, bread has\\, any sawdust.\\,\\,\\, You should\\, really just\\, taste it."
msgstr "Hum...\\,\\,\\, não que o meu\\, pão tenha\\, serragem.\\,\\,\\, Você devia\\, só\\, provar."

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.11.text"
msgid "God dag\\,, my friend!\\,\\,\\, Looking to\\, buy some\\, soft\\, and tasty\\, artisan bread?\\,\\,\\, Would you\\, like to buy some?"
msgstr "God dag\\,, meu amigo!\\,\\,\\, Quer\\, comprar um\\, pão artesanal\\, macio\\, e gostoso?\\,\\,\\, Vai\\, querer?"

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.12.text"
msgid "Hejsan!\\,\\,\\, We have\\, the finest bread\\, in Obenseuer\\,\\,, packed\\, with...\\,\\, uh\\,\\,, natural\\, fiber!"
msgstr "Hejsan!\\,\\,\\, Temos\\, o melhor pão\\, de Obenseuer\\,\\,, cheio\\, de...\\,\\, hã\\,\\,, fibras\\, naturais!"

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.13.text"
msgid "God dag!\\,\\,\\, Looking for\\, some\\, hearty\\,\\,, filling\\, artisan bread?"
msgstr "God dag!\\,\\,\\, Procurando\\, um\\, pão artesanal\\, robusto\\,\\,, que\\, sustenta?"

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.15.text"
msgid "Do you know where that woman wearing a trench coat went?"
msgstr "Sabe para onde foi aquela mulher de sobretudo?"

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.16.text"
msgid "Oi!\\, Ja!\\,\\, She had to leave early...\\,\\, She asked me to\\, tell you\\, she'll be sending you\\, something in the mail soon."
msgstr "Oi!\\, Ja!\\,\\, Ela teve que sair mais cedo...\\,\\, Me pediu para\\, te avisar\\, que vai te mandar\\, uma coisa pelo correio em breve."

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.17.text"
msgid "Didn't say what it was\\,, though.\\,\\, She seemed to be\\, in quite a hurry."
msgstr "Mas não disse o que era\\,, viu.\\,\\, Parecia estar\\, com muita pressa."

#: Bazaar/Trader/Gustav Sågspånberg
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.51.19.text"
msgid "Anyway\\,, can I\\, get you anything?\\,\\,\\, We've got some\\, freshly baked bread!"
msgstr "Enfim\\,, posso\\, te servir alguma coisa?\\,\\,\\, Temos\\, pão fresquinho!"

#: Bazaar/Trader/Jens Brom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.25.1.text"
msgid "Heh heh.\\,\\, I got stuff!"
msgstr "Rê rê.\\,\\, Tenho mercadoria!"

