msgctxt "dlg.84.1.text"
msgid "Another victim...\\,\\,\\,\\, it doesn't seem to react\\,\\, to anything.\\,\\,\\,\\, What do we do with it?\\,\\,\\, We can't save it\\,\\,\\,, but there is something weird about this one.\\,\\,\\, I need to\\,\\, examine it more closely."
msgstr "Mais uma vítima...\\,\\,\\,\\, não parece reagir\\,\\, a nada.\\,\\,\\,\\, O que fazemos com isso?\\,\\,\\, Não dá para salvar\\,\\,\\,, mas tem algo estranho neste aqui.\\,\\,\\, Preciso\\,\\, examinar mais de perto."

