msgid "There is no space here\\,\\,\\,\\,, so we have to transfer it to the quarantine zone.\\,\\,\\, We can\\, get it from there later.\\,\\,\\, I'm not sure\\,\\, if it can move yet\\,\\,\\,, but those\\, red mushrooms\\, might affect it."
msgstr "Não tem espaço aqui\\,\\,\\,\\,, então vamos ter que transferir para a zona de quarentena.\\,\\,\\, Podemos\\, buscar lá depois.\\,\\,\\, Não sei\\,\\, se já consegue se mexer\\,\\,\\,, mas aqueles\\, cogumelos vermelhos\\, podem afetar isso."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.1.menu"
msgid "Are you ready?"
msgstr "Está {{pronto|pronta}}?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.2.text"
msgid "I'm ready"
msgstr "Estou {{pronto|pronta}}"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.3.text"
msgid "Personal? What do you mean?"
msgstr "Pessoais? Como assim?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.4.text"
msgid "Why do you have these screens?"
msgstr "Por que vocês têm essas telas?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.5.text"
msgid "I have no reason to be here! Let me out!"
msgstr "Não tenho motivo nenhum para estar aqui! Me deixem sair!"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.6.text"
msgid "You'll see.\\,\\,\\, So\\,\\,\\,, are you ready?"
msgstr "Você vai ver.\\,\\,\\, Então\\,\\,\\,, está {{pronto|pronta}}?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.7.text"
msgid "This is for security reasons.\\,\\,\\,\\, Are you ready?"
msgstr "É por motivos de segurança.\\,\\,\\,\\, Está {{pronto|pronta}}?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.8.text"
msgid "[lua(Variable[\"PlayerLastName\"])].\\,\\, Everyone is sent here\\, for a reason.\\,\\,\\, We cannot\\, let you go.\\,\\,\\, However\\,\\,, you can apply for permission to visit the outside at a later time.\\,\\,\\, So\\,\\,, are you ready?"
msgstr "[lua(Variable[\"PlayerLastName\"])].\\,\\, Todo mundo é mandado para cá\\, por um motivo.\\,\\,\\, Não podemos\\, deixar você ir.\\,\\,\\, Mas\\,\\,, você pode pedir permissão para visitar o lado de fora mais tarde.\\,\\,\\, Então\\,\\,, está {{pronto|pronta}}?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.9.text"
msgid "That's all.\\,\\,\\, So...\\,\\,\\, you're going to\\, get\\, this\\,.\\,.\\,.\\,\\,\\,\\, unfinished\\, block of flats."
msgstr "É só isso.\\,\\,\\, Então...\\,\\,\\, você vai\\, ficar\\, com este\\,.\\,.\\,.\\,\\,\\,\\, prédio\\, inacabado."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.11.text"
msgid "What am I supposed to do with that tenement?"
msgstr "O que eu devo fazer com esse prédio?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.15.text"
msgid "Maybe you should go there and investigate it first.\\,\\,\\, It's not really our job to tell you what to do with it."
msgstr "Talvez você devesse ir lá e investigar primeiro.\\,\\,\\, Não é bem trabalho nosso dizer o que você deve fazer com ele."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.16.text"
msgid "Why are you giving it to me?"
msgstr "Por que vocês estão me dando isso?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.17.text"
msgid "Because...\\,\\,\\, there is currently\\, a severe shortage\\, of vacant apartments,\\,\\,\\, and there are many\\,\\, people without\\, a home."
msgstr "Porque...\\,\\,\\, no momento há\\, uma grave escassez\\, de apartamentos vagos,\\,\\,\\, e muitas\\,\\, pessoas sem\\, ter onde morar."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.18.text"
msgid "Can you tell me something about Obenseuer?"
msgstr "Pode me contar alguma coisa sobre Obenseuer?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.19.text"
msgid "There are\\,\\, a few things that would be good to know.\\,\\,\\,\\, First of all\\,\\,\\,, they have their own currency called\\,\\,\\, Open Sewer Coins,\\,\\,\\, or simply OC."
msgstr "Tem\\,\\, algumas coisas que é bom saber.\\,\\,\\,\\, Primeiro\\,\\,\\,, eles têm a própria moeda, chamada\\,\\,\\, Moedas do Esgoto Aberto,\\,\\,\\, ou simplesmente OC."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.20.text"
msgid "Can I go now?"
msgstr "Já posso ir?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.21.text"
msgid "You can go...\\,\\,\\, but before that...\\,\\,\\, be sure to take your package with you.\\,\\,\\, We'll send it to you in a moment.\\,\\,\\, Wait at the vending machine."
msgstr "Pode ir...\\,\\,\\, mas antes...\\,\\,\\, não esqueça de levar seu pacote.\\,\\,\\, Vamos mandar daqui a pouco.\\,\\,\\, Espere na máquina de venda."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.22.text"
msgid "Whatever.\\,\\,\\, You get\\, the whole\\, building.\\,\\,\\, It's\\, yours.\\,\\,\\, Its location should be marked on the map in front of you.\\,\\,\\,\\, Do you have any\\, questions?"
msgstr "Que seja.\\,\\,\\, Você fica\\, com o prédio\\, inteiro.\\,\\,\\, É\\, seu.\\,\\,\\, A localização deve estar marcada no mapa à sua frente.\\,\\,\\,\\, Tem alguma\\, pergunta?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.23.text"
msgid "There has to be something wrong with this."
msgstr "Deve ter algum erro nisso."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.24.text"
msgid "Second, Obenseuer is full of\\, sick and\\,\\, strange people...\\,\\,\\, so be careful...\\,\\,\\,\\, and finally...\\,\\,\\,\\, stay away from green mushrooms."
msgstr "Segundo, Obenseuer está cheia de\\, gente doente e\\,\\, estranha...\\,\\,\\, então tome cuidado...\\,\\,\\,\\, e por último...\\,\\,\\,\\, fique longe dos cogumelos verdes."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.25.text"
msgid "[lua(Variable[\"PlayerFirstName\"])] [lua(Variable[\"PlayerLastName\"])].\\,\\,\\, We have to ask a few questions\\,\\, for your own safety.\\,\\,\\, Some of these questions\\, are\\, personal.\\,\\, This information is important\\, for finding a cure for\\, the fungal disease."
msgstr "[lua(Variable[\"PlayerFirstName\"])] [lua(Variable[\"PlayerLastName\"])].\\,\\,\\, Precisamos fazer algumas perguntas\\,\\, para sua própria segurança.\\,\\, Algumas dessas perguntas\\, são\\, pessoais.\\,\\, Estas informações são importantes\\, para encontrar uma cura para\\, a doença fúngica."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Interviewer
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.83.26.text"
msgid "We don't have an answer for that\\,\\,, because we don't decide these things...\\,\\,\\, but I...\\,\\,\\, we believe it's a mistake."
msgstr "Não temos resposta para isso\\,\\,, porque não somos nós que decidimos essas coisas...\\,\\,\\, mas eu...\\,\\,\\, nós achamos que é um erro."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Intro
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.17.11.text"
msgid "Hello\\,?\\,\\,\\,\\, Am I in the right place?\\,\\,\\,\\, Why is it so\\,\\,\\, dark in here?"
msgstr "Olá\\,?\\,\\,\\,\\, Estou no lugar certo?\\,\\,\\,\\, Por que está tão\\,\\,\\, escuro aqui?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Intro
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.17.12.text"
msgid "The city of Stalburg has made great progress\\, in dealing with its\\, homeless crisis..."
msgstr "A cidade de Stalburg fez grandes avanços\\, no combate à sua\\, crise de pessoas em situação de rua..."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Intro
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.17.13.text"
msgid "Unfortunately\\,\\,, the Obenseuer area has been ravaged\\, by some kind of fungal disease."
msgstr "Infelizmente\\,\\,, a região de Obenseuer foi devastada\\, por algum tipo de doença fúngica."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Intro
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.17.14.text"
msgid "The disease\\, is believed to be caused by\\, glowing green mushrooms\\, found all over the district."
msgstr "Acredita-se que a doença\\, seja causada por\\, cogumelos verdes brilhantes\\, encontrados por todo o distrito."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Intro
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.17.15.text"
msgid "Now the government is planning to completely eradicate\\, these mushrooms from the city."
msgstr "Agora o governo planeja erradicar completamente\\, esses cogumelos da cidade."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Intro
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.17.16.text"
msgid "All individuals\\, who have been diagnosed with the fungal disease\\, have been evacuated to a quarantined area\\, within Obenseuer..."
msgstr "Todos os indivíduos\\, diagnosticados com a doença fúngica\\, foram evacuados para uma área de quarentena\\, dentro de Obenseuer..."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Intro
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.17.18.text"
msgid "The massive influx\\, of new residents\\, has created a major housing shortage\\, in Obenseuer."
msgstr "A chegada em massa\\, de novos moradores\\, criou uma grave falta de moradia\\, em Obenseuer."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Intro
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.17.19.text"
msgid "Locals frequently report violence\\,, famine\\,, poor hygiene\\,, alcohol-related problems\\, and various diseases."
msgstr "Os moradores relatam com frequência violência\\,, fome\\,, falta de higiene\\,, problemas com álcool\\, e diversas doenças."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Intro
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.17.20.text"
msgid "Entering\\, or leaving\\, the quarantine area\\, is strictly\\, forbidden."
msgstr "É estritamente\\, proibido\\, entrar\\, ou sair\\, da área de quarentena."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Intro
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.17.21.text"
msgid "I\\,\\,\\, brought the red ones\\,\\,\\, and...\\,\\,\\, Hello?\\,\\,\\, Anyone?"
msgstr "Eu\\,\\,\\, trouxe os vermelhos\\,\\,\\, e...\\,\\,\\, Olá?\\,\\,\\, Alguém?"

#: CutScenes/Intro/Intro
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.17.22.text"
msgid "due to recent efforts to relocate all\\, homeless individuals to the district of\\, Obenseuer\\,\\,, locally known as\\,\\, Open Sewer."
msgstr "devido aos recentes esforços para realocar todas as\\, pessoas em situação de rua no distrito de\\, Obenseuer\\,\\,, conhecido localmente como\\,\\, Esgoto Aberto."

#: CutScenes/Intro/Intro
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.17.23.text"
msgid "as researchers are still trying to find a cure."
msgstr "enquanto os pesquisadores ainda tentam encontrar uma cura."

#: Deekula/Adam Holmgren
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.81.1.text"
msgid "You can take\\,\\, whatever you want here\\,\\, as long as you don't touch my stuff\\,\\, behind the televisions."
