#: Deekula/Adam Holmgren
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.81.7.text"
msgid "We are all sick here.\\,\\,\\, You and me...\\,\\, everyone.\\,\\,\\, We are all crazy and\\,\\, living in a delusion."
