#: Deekula/Amanda Korhonen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.63.77.text"
msgid "I was\\,\\, evicted from my\\, own apartment."
msgstr "Eu fui\\,\\, despejada do meu\\, próprio apartamento."

#: Deekula/Amanda Korhonen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.63.78.text"
msgid "She\\, started gossiping about things\\,\\, that were not true...\\,\\, like... "
msgstr "Ela\\, começou a espalhar fofoca\\,\\, sobre coisas que não eram verdade...\\,\\, tipo... "

#: Deekula/Amanda Korhonen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.63.79.text"
msgid "Well...\\,\\, she was\\, carrying a bunch of radio receivers\\, to her apartment.\\,\\, I have no idea\\, why she would need so many of them."
msgstr "Bom...\\,\\, ela vivia levando um monte de receptores de rádio\\, para o apartamento dela.\\,\\, Não faço ideia\\, de para que ela precisaria de tantos."

#: Deekula/Amanda Korhonen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.63.80.text"
msgid "She seems to be\\, a painter and\\, um...\\,\\, well..."
msgstr "Parece que ela é\\, pintora e\\, hum...\\,\\, bom..."

#: Deekula/Amanda Korhonen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.63.81.text"
msgid "It must be her."
msgstr "Só pode ser ela."

#: Deekula/Amanda Korhonen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.63.82.text"
msgid "That's\\,\\, weird...\\,\\, I haven't seen her for\\, a while\\, and she was fine the last time I saw her."
msgstr "Que\\,\\, estranho...\\,\\, faz\\, um tempo que não vejo ela\\, e ela estava bem da última vez que a vi."

#: Deekula/Amanda Korhonen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.63.83.text"
msgid "I mean...\\,\\, \"fine\".\\,\\,\\, She was\\, already messed up then\\, but that sounds weird."
msgstr "Quer dizer...\\,\\, “bem”.\\,\\,\\, Ela já\\, estava meio pirada naquela época\\, mas isso soa estranho."

#: Deekula/Amanda Korhonen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.63.84.text"
msgid "I was sure that there was something wrong with her...\\,\\, that finger...\\,\\, I'm trying to find something."
