#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.66.text"
msgid "You are at the wrong Passmore's door\\,\\, and you're in the wrong\\, building."
msgstr "Você está na porta do Passmore errado\\,\\, e no prédio\\, errado."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.67.text"
msgid "Where does he live?"
msgstr "Onde ele mora?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.68.text"
msgid "Oh, sorry (Leave)"
msgstr "Ah, desculpe (Sair)"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.69.text"
msgid "He lives in the building next door."
msgstr "Ele mora no prédio aqui do lado."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.70.text"
msgid "There is an alley next to the O-Market."
msgstr "Tem um beco ao lado do O-Market."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.71.text"
msgid "The name of the building is\\,\\, Tenement B."
msgstr "O nome do prédio é\\,\\, Prédio B."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.72.text"
msgid "Thanks (Leave)"
msgstr "Valeu (Sair)"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.73.text"
msgid "I know, he sent me to you"
msgstr "Eu sei, foi ele que me mandou até você"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.74.text"
msgid "I went to the basement of Deekula B"
msgstr "Eu fui ao porão do Deekula B"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.75.text"
msgid "And\\,\\, what did you find?"
msgstr "E\\,\\, o que você encontrou?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.76.text"
msgid "A guy called Hanss lives there"
msgstr "Um cara chamado Hanss mora lá"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.77.text"
msgid "I spoke to a person named Anya"
msgstr "Falei com uma pessoa chamada Anya"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.78.text"
msgid "Oh\\,\\,, I\\, didn't know\\, her name...\\,\\, was Hanss there?"
msgstr "Ah\\,\\,, eu\\, não sabia\\, o nome dela...\\,\\, o Hanss estava lá?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.79.text"
msgid "Anya asked me to find him"
msgstr "A Anya me pediu para encontrar ele"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.80.text"
msgid "So\\, he's still in the mines\\,\\,, right?"
msgstr "Então\\, ele ainda está nas minas\\,\\,, certo?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.81.text"
msgid "Is he...\\,\\, okay?"
msgstr "Ele está...\\,\\, bem?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.82.text"
msgid "Please\\, find him\\,\\, and I will make you a passport."
msgstr "Por favor\\, encontre ele\\,\\, e eu faço um passaporte para você."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.83.text"
msgid "He wasn't there"
msgstr "Ele não estava lá"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.84.text"
msgid "He wasn't there, but Anya asked me to find him"
msgstr "Ele não estava lá, mas a Anya me pediu para encontrar ele"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.85.text"
msgid "Anya?\\,\\, I didn't know her\\, name."
msgstr "Anya?\\,\\, Eu não sabia o\\, nome dela."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.86.text"
msgid "So Hanss is still in\\, the mines."
msgstr "Então o Hanss ainda está\\, nas minas."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.87.text"
msgid "How do you know Hanss?"
msgstr "De onde você conhece o Hanss?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.88.text"
msgid "We...\\,\\, um..."
msgstr "Nós...\\,\\, hã..."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.89.text"
msgid "He is my\\, close friend\\,\\, and I\\, have helped him find his friend Lukas."
msgstr "Ele é um\\, grande amigo\\,\\, e eu\\, ajudei ele a encontrar o amigo dele, o Lukas."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.90.text"
msgid "How is he?"
msgstr "Como ele está?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.91.text"
msgid "You know Hanss?"
msgstr "Você conhece o Hanss?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.92.text"
msgid "When will I get the passport?"
msgstr "Quando vou receber o passaporte?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.93.text"
msgid "I\\, already told you...\\,\\,\\, find Hanss\\, in the mines first\\,\\, and then we can talk about\\, making a passport."
msgstr "Eu\\, já te disse...\\,\\,\\, primeiro encontre o Hanss\\, nas minas\\,\\, e depois a gente fala sobre\\, fazer um passaporte."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.94.text"
msgid "I have news about Hanss"
msgstr "Tenho notícias do Hanss"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.95.text"
msgid "Where is he?"
msgstr "Onde ele está?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.98.text"
msgid "There's been a collapse in the mines"
msgstr "Houve um desabamento nas minas"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.99.text"
msgid "Is he okay?"
msgstr "Ele está bem?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.100.text"
msgid "Yeah, Anya thinks he's fine"
msgstr "Sim, a Anya acha que ele está bem"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.101.text"
msgid "I...\\,\\,\\, trust that he's fine.\\,\\,\\, He's always been prepared for emergencies."
msgstr "Eu...\\,\\,\\, confio que ele está bem.\\,\\,\\, Ele sempre esteve preparado para emergências."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.103.text"
msgid "We are looking for another route"
msgstr "Estamos procurando outro caminho"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.104.text"
msgid "Good...\\,\\, do you know where that other route is?"
msgstr "Ótimo...\\,\\, você sabe onde fica esse outro caminho?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.105.text"
msgid "Someone at the Bazaar might know"
msgstr "Alguém no Bazar talvez saiba"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.106.text"
msgid "So...\\,\\, what are we waiting for?"
msgstr "Então...\\,\\, o que estamos esperando?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.107.text"
msgid "Come in\\, and I'll\\, take a photo for the passport."
msgstr "Entre\\, e eu\\, tiro uma foto para o passaporte."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.109.text"
msgid "Oh no\\,\\,, what happened?"
msgstr "Ah, não\\,\\,, o que aconteceu?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.110.text"
msgid "I think he's probably alright"
msgstr "Acho que ele provavelmente está bem"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.111.text"
msgid "We think there's a chance he might be alright"
msgstr "Achamos que há uma chance de ele estar bem"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.112.text"
msgid "We can't waste time.\\,\\,\\, So...\\,\\, what are we going to do next?"
msgstr "Não podemos perder tempo.\\,\\,\\, Então...\\,\\, qual é o próximo passo?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.113.text"
msgid "But still\\,\\,, being trapped like that must be terrifying."
msgstr "Mesmo assim\\,\\,, ficar preso daquele jeito deve ser apavorante."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.114.text"
msgid "I have no idea"
msgstr "Não faço ideia"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.115.text"
msgid "Anya knows that there's another route"
msgstr "A Anya sabe que existe outro caminho"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.145.116.text"
msgid "Yes, but I have to get to the Bazaar"
msgstr "Sim, mas eu preciso chegar ao Bazar"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.1.text"
msgid "Look at the camera."
