#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.14.text"
msgid "I\\, have to get this passport done.\\,\\,\\, You can leave now."
msgstr "Eu\\, preciso terminar este passaporte.\\,\\,\\, Pode ir agora."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.15.text"
msgid "Can I ask something?"
msgstr "Posso perguntar uma coisa?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.16.text"
msgid "I have to go (Leave)"
msgstr "Tenho que ir (Sair)"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.17.text"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "Sim?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.18.text"
msgid "How did you and Hanss meet?"
msgstr "Como você e o Hanss se conheceram?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.19.text"
msgid "Actually, I have to go (Leave)"
msgstr "Na verdade, tenho que ir (Sair)"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.20.text"
msgid "Well\\,\\,, it's quite similar to\\, how I met you."
msgstr "Bom\\,\\,, foi bem parecido com\\, o jeito que conheci você."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.21.text"
msgid "It was a few years ago.\\,\\,\\, Hanss came to me with a request\\, for a forged passport."
msgstr "Foi há alguns anos.\\,\\,\\, O Hanss veio até mim pedindo\\, um passaporte falso."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.22.text"
msgid "He needed to get to the Bazaar urgently\\,\\, for some personal reasons."
msgstr "Ele precisava chegar ao Bazar com urgência\\,\\, por motivos pessoais."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.23.text"
msgid "We got to talking during the process\\,\\,, and\\, we realized\\, we had some\\, common\\, interests\\,\\, and experiences."
msgstr "A gente começou a conversar durante o processo\\,\\,, e\\, percebemos\\, que tínhamos alguns\\, interesses\\,\\, e experiências\\, em comum."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.24.text"
msgid "Can you tell me about the priest?"
msgstr "Pode me falar do padre?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.25.text"
msgid "I\\,\\, don't really want to gossip about him, but..."
msgstr "Eu\\,\\, não gosto muito de fofocar sobre ele, mas..."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Eliana Passmore Camera
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.178.26.text"
msgid "What do you know about Anya?"
