#: Tenement/Kolhola/Liouba Bennett
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.151.4.text"
msgid "Who needs\\, sleep\\,\\, when\\, there’s\\, this much\\, work to do?"
msgstr "Quem precisa\\, dormir\\,\\, quando\\, tem\\, tanto\\, trabalho para fazer?"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Meri Haka
#, fuzzy
