#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.128.10.text"
msgid "Complaints are not handled here, they're handled by a different department."
msgstr "Reclamações não são tratadas aqui, ficam com outro departamento."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Telemarketer_Doorphone
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.128.11.text"
msgid "(Leave)"
msgstr "(Sair)"

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Telemarketer_Doorphone
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.128.12.text"
