#: Tenement/Kolhola/Telemarketer_Doorphone
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.128.14.text"
msgid "Yes!\\,\\,\\, We could always use extra hands\\,\\,\\,, or more like\\, mouths here."
msgstr "Sim!\\,\\,\\, Sempre cabem mais mãos\\,\\,\\,, ou melhor\\, bocas por aqui."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Telemarketer_Doorphone
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.128.15.text"
msgid "The base pay is\\, 45 OC per hour\\,\\,, depending on how you perform.\\,\\,\\, A good caller can make\\, hundreds of OC per hour."
msgstr "O salário-base é\\, 45 OC por hora\\,\\,, dependendo do seu desempenho.\\,\\,\\, Um bom operador pode ganhar\\, centenas de OC por hora."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Telemarketer_Doorphone
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.128.16.text"
msgid "The art of telemarketing is\\, pretty much just\\,\\, bribery.\\,\\,\\, Lure and bribe new subscribers with\\, non-existent subscription bonuses\\, and whatnot.\\,\\,\\, But anyway..."
msgstr "A arte do telemarketing é\\, basicamente\\,\\, suborno.\\,\\,\\, Atrair e subornar novos assinantes com\\, brindes de assinatura que não existem\\, e por aí vai.\\,\\,\\, Mas enfim..."

#: Tenement/Kolhola/Telemarketer_Doorphone
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.128.17.text"
msgid "The workday is 8 hours\\,, you can start anytime between 6\\, and 12.\\,\\,\\, Are you ready to start?"
