#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Mr. Blue Duck
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.93.77.menu"
msgid "<color=#9b8a35>Quack!!</color>\\,\\,\\, Okay..."
msgstr "<color=#9b8a35>Quá!!</color>\\,\\,\\, Tá bom..."

