#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Mr. Blue Duck
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.93.87.text"
msgid "<color=#9b8a35>Quack</color>?\\,\\, <color=#9b8a35>Quack quack quack</color>!\\,\\,\\, It's broken!"
msgstr "<color=#9b8a35>Quá</color>?\\,\\, <color=#9b8a35>Quá quá quá</color>!\\,\\,\\, Está quebrado!"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Mr. Blue Duck
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.93.88.text"
msgid "That little <color=#9b8a35>quack</color>!\\,\\,\\, He did this!\\,\\,\\, <color=#9b8a35>Quack quack quack</color>!"
msgstr "Aquele <color=#9b8a35>quazinho</color>!\\,\\,\\, Foi ele que fez isso!\\,\\,\\, <color=#9b8a35>Quá quá quá</color>!"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Mr. Blue Duck
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.93.89.text"
msgid "Here!\\,\\,\\, <color=#9b8a35>Quack!</color>"
msgstr "Aqui!\\,\\,\\, <color=#9b8a35>Quá!</color>"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Mr. Blue Duck
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.93.90.text"
msgid "Sounds good"
msgstr "Parece bom"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Mr. Blue Duck
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.93.91.text"
msgid "I don't want it"
msgstr "Não quero"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Mr. Blue Duck
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.93.93.text"
msgid "<color=#9b8a35>Quack quack quack</color>!\\,\\,\\, Did that <color=#9b8a35>quack</color> killer tell you something bad about my little <color=#1d54bd>blue quack</color>?\\,\\,\\, Are you sure that you don't want it?\\,\\,\\, It would make you very <color=#9b8a35>quack quack</color> happy <color=#9b8a35>quack!</color>"
msgstr "<color=#9b8a35>Quá quá quá</color>!\\,\\,\\, Aquele assassino de <color=#9b8a35>quá</color> te falou alguma coisa ruim do meu pequeno <color=#1d54bd>quá azul</color>?\\,\\,\\, Tem certeza de que não quer?\\,\\,\\, Ia te deixar muito <color=#9b8a35>quá quá</color> feliz <color=#9b8a35>quá!</color>"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Mr. Blue Duck
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.93.97.text"
msgid "... I have another precious little\\, <color=#1d54bd>blue quack</color>!\\,\\,\\, I'll give it to you because you found my <color=#1d54bd>blue quack</color>!\\,\\,\\, <color=#9b8a35>Quack quack</color>!"
msgstr "... Eu tenho outro precioso\\, <color=#1d54bd>quá azul</color>!\\,\\,\\, Vou te dar porque você encontrou o meu <color=#1d54bd>quá azul</color>!\\,\\,\\, <color=#9b8a35>Quá quá</color>!"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Mr. Blue Duck
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.93.98.text"
msgid "But don't worry!\\,\\,\\, <color=#9b8a35>Quack quack quack!</color>\\,\\,\\, Wait...\\,\\,\\, I'm going to get you a big <color=#9b8a35>quack</color>..."
msgstr "Mas não se preocupe!\\,\\,\\, <color=#9b8a35>Quá quá quá!</color>\\,\\,\\, Espera...\\,\\,\\, Vou buscar um grande <color=#9b8a35>quá</color> para você..."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.2.text"
msgid "(Leave)"
msgstr "(Sair)"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.3.text"
msgid "I want to buy a drink (Buy)"
msgstr "Quero comprar uma bebida (Comprar)"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.4.text"
msgid "I heard you could use some help here"
msgstr "Ouvi dizer que você está precisando de ajuda aqui"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.6.text"
msgid "Well\\,\\,, you heard right.\\,\\,\\, I make most of the drinks myself\\,\\,, but I buy the mash elsewhere...\\,\\, and I have a...\\,\\, problem with that."
msgstr "Bom\\,\\,, ouviu certo.\\,\\,\\, Eu mesmo faço a maioria das bebidas\\,\\,, mas compro a garapa de fora...\\,\\, e estou com um...\\,\\, problema com isso."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.11.text"
msgid "I hope that I don't have to start selling only...\\,\\, um...\\,\\, Osmo Olut...\\,\\, I know some\\, customers like it\\,\\,, but still...\\,\\, -sigh-...\\,\\,\\, I guess I'll have to find\\, another\\, supplier."
msgstr "Espero não ter que começar a vender só...\\,\\, hum...\\,\\, Osmo Olut...\\,\\, sei que alguns\\, clientes gostam\\,\\,, mas mesmo assim...\\,\\, -suspiro-...\\,\\,\\, Acho que vou ter que arranjar\\, outro\\, fornecedor."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.13.text"
msgid "Perhaps I could help you?"
msgstr "Talvez eu possa te ajudar?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.14.text"
msgid "Oh?\\,\\, You probably want some reward?\\,\\, Anyway...\\,\\,\\, I used to get my mash from a guy called...\\,\\,\\, Max Masher.\\,\\, He makes some damn good mash\\,\\, and mashing is everything for him\\,\\,, but I haven't heard anything from him for ages!"
msgstr "Ah, é?\\,\\, Você deve querer alguma recompensa, né?\\,\\, Enfim...\\,\\,\\, Eu comprava a minha garapa de um cara chamado...\\,\\,\\, Max Masher.\\,\\, Ele faz uma garapa boa pra caramba\\,\\, e fazer garapa é a vida dele\\,\\,, mas faz séculos que não tenho notícia dele!"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.15.text"
msgid "Where could I find him?"
msgstr "Onde eu posso encontrá-lo?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.16.text"
msgid "I tried to ask people where he might live\\,\\,, but no one wanted to help\\, or knew where he lived."
msgstr "Tentei perguntar por aí onde ele mora\\,\\,, mas ninguém quis ajudar\\, nem sabia onde ele morava."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.17.text"
msgid "Okay, I'll try to find him"
msgstr "Certo, vou tentar encontrá-lo"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.18.text"
msgid "Yes, but I need a drink before I go! (Buy)"
msgstr "Sim, mas antes preciso de uma bebida! (Comprar)"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.22.text"
msgid "And?\\,\\,\\, What\\, did he say?\\,\\,\\, Is he able to make mash?"
msgstr "E aí?\\,\\,\\, O que\\, ele disse?\\,\\,\\, Ele consegue fazer garapa?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.23.text"
msgid "He told me that beets don't grow in winter..."
msgstr "Ele me disse que beterraba não cresce no inverno..."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.24.text"
msgid "Nothing meaningful..."
msgstr "Nada que preste..."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.25.text"
msgid "And then?"
msgstr "E depois?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.26.text"
msgid "He told me to fetch 10 packs of sugar and 5 packs of yeast for mashing"
msgstr "Ele me pediu 10 pacotes de açúcar e 5 de levedura para fazer a garapa"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.28.text"
msgid "Okay, good.\\,\\, Maybe then I can get some mash for my Kilju. "
msgstr "Certo, ótimo.\\,\\, Quem sabe assim eu consigo garapa para o meu Kilju. "

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.29.text"
msgid "Well, I met Max, and his mind is totally mashed"
msgstr "Bom, encontrei o Max, e a cabeça dele virou garapa"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.30.text"
msgid "So...\\,\\, um...\\, is he able to make me mash?"
msgstr "Então...\\,\\, hum...\\, ele consegue fazer garapa para mim?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.31.text"
msgid "Doesn't look like it. I brought him a lot of stuff, and he just keeps chanting there"
msgstr "Parece que não. Levei um monte de coisas para ele, e ele só fica lá entoando cânticos"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.32.text"
msgid "Oh crap!\\,\\,\\, Where do I get my mash now?"
msgstr "Ah, merda!\\,\\,\\, De onde eu vou tirar garapa agora?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.34.text"
msgid "Uh... maybe I could help you with that"
msgstr "Hã... talvez eu possa te ajudar com isso"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.35.text"
msgid "I could, if I knew how to mash"
msgstr "Até poderia, se eu soubesse fazer garapa"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.36.text"
msgid "Could you try asking him if he's still able to teach you?\\,\\,\\, I mean...\\, he's still able to talk\\,\\,, right?"
msgstr "Você podia perguntar a ele se ele ainda consegue te ensinar?\\,\\,\\, Quer dizer...\\, ele ainda consegue falar\\,\\,, né?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.37.text"
msgid "Yes!\\,\\, Yes!\\,\\, I'm going to pay you the market price for every 10 buckets of\\,\\, sugar mash\\, you manage to bring me!"
msgstr "Sim!\\,\\, Sim!\\,\\, Vou te pagar o preço de mercado a cada 10 baldes de\\,\\, garapa de açúcar\\, que você conseguir me trazer!"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.38.text"
msgid "Sounds like a deal!"
msgstr "Fechado!"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.39.text"
msgid "I could try..."
msgstr "Posso tentar..."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.40.text"
msgid "I'm not going to talk with that mash head again!"
msgstr "Não vou falar com aquele cabeça de garapa de novo!"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.41.text"
msgid "Well\\,\\,, anyway...\\,\\,\\, I'll pay you the market price for every 10 buckets of sugar mash you manage to bring."
msgstr "Bom\\,\\,, de qualquer forma...\\,\\,\\, vou te pagar o preço de mercado a cada 10 baldes de garapa de açúcar que você conseguir me trazer."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.42.text"
msgid "I'm here to sell you some mash!"
msgstr "Vim te vender garapa!"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.43.text"
msgid "Good!\\,\\, Got 10 buckets of sugar mash for me?"
msgstr "Ótimo!\\,\\, Tem 10 baldes de garapa de açúcar para mim?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.44.text"
msgid "Yeah, I do! (Give)"
msgstr "Tenho, sim! (Entregar)"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.45.text"
msgid "Oops! I forgot (Leave)"
msgstr "Opa! Esqueci (Sair)"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.46.text"
msgid "And here's the payment!"
msgstr "E aqui está o pagamento!"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.47.text"
msgid "Also...\\,\\,\\, here's something for your efforts in solving this mystery..."
msgstr "Além disso...\\,\\,\\, aqui vai uma coisinha pelo seu esforço em resolver esse mistério..."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.48.text"
msgid "What problem?"
msgstr "Que problema?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.49.text"
msgid "That's bad, but I have to go now (Leave)"
msgstr "Que pena, mas preciso ir agora (Sair)"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.50.text"
msgid "Max Masher? Interesting name"
msgstr "Max Masher? Nome interessante"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.51.text"
msgid "We still don't know who...\\,\\,\\, It was a surprise that he survived...\\,\\, but now...\\,\\, well...\\,\\, he's not the sharpest tool\\,\\, in the shed."
msgstr "Ainda não sabemos quem foi...\\,\\,\\, Foi uma surpresa ele ter sobrevivido...\\,\\, mas agora...\\,\\, bom...\\,\\, ele não é a lâmpada mais brilhante\\,\\, do lustre."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.52.text"
msgid "I want to know about the reward"
msgstr "Quero saber da recompensa"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.53.text"
msgid "I'll...\\,\\, figure something out...\\,\\, don't worry.\\,\\,\\, Maybe some good drinks\\,\\, or discount.\\,\\, We'll see\\,\\, when you've done it."
msgstr "Eu...\\,\\, dou um jeito...\\,\\, não se preocupe.\\,\\,\\, Quem sabe umas boas bebidas\\,\\, ou um desconto.\\,\\, A gente vê\\,\\, quando você tiver resolvido."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.54.text"
msgid "He just told me to get some stuff for mashing"
msgstr "Ele só me pediu para arranjar umas coisas para fazer garapa"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.55.text"
msgid "Nothing special really..."
msgstr "Nada de especial, na verdade..."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.56.text"
msgid "Well...\\,\\, I hope he can still make some mash.\\,\\, Maybe you should talk to him more...\\,\\, I really need some mash for my Kilju."
msgstr "Bom...\\,\\, espero que ele ainda consiga fazer garapa.\\,\\, Talvez você devesse conversar mais com ele...\\,\\, eu preciso muito de garapa para o meu Kilju."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.57.text"
msgid "Yeah, of course! He's totally fine! He's already started making mash"
msgstr "Claro! Ele está ótimo! Já começou a fazer garapa"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.58.text"
msgid "Well, it's your problem. Where is my reward?"
msgstr "Bom, o problema é seu. Cadê a minha recompensa?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.59.text"
msgid "Nope, and I'm not going to waste my time on this. Where is my reward?"
msgstr "Não, e não vou perder meu tempo com isso. Cadê a minha recompensa?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.60.text"
msgid "Oh!\\,\\, That's good to hear!\\,\\,\\, I hope he's able to bring me some mash soon!\\,\\, Here's\\, something for your efforts!\\,\\, I hope Max is doing fine..."
msgstr "Ah!\\,\\, Que bom saber!\\,\\,\\, Espero que ele consiga me trazer garapa logo!\\,\\, Aqui vai\\, uma coisinha pelo seu esforço!\\,\\, Espero que o Max esteja bem..."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.61.text"
msgid "Here's your reward."
msgstr "Aqui está a sua recompensa."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.62.text"
msgid "Oh damn...\\,\\, well...\\,\\, here's your reward.\\,\\, I'll probably have to start to...\\,\\,\\, make some fecal kilju now...\\,\\, my customers are not going to like this at all...\\,\\, if they still come here..."
msgstr "Ah, droga...\\,\\, bom...\\,\\, aqui está a sua recompensa.\\,\\, Acho que vou ter que começar a...\\,\\,\\, fazer kilju fecal agora...\\,\\, meus clientes não vão gostar nada disso...\\,\\, se é que ainda vão aparecer..."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.63.text"
msgid "I\\, haven't seen you here before.\\,\\,\\, Welcome to the speakeasy!"
msgstr "Eu\\, nunca te vi por aqui.\\,\\,\\, {{Bem-vindo|Bem-vinda}} ao bar clandestino!"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.64.text"
msgid "Welcome back!"
msgstr "{{Bem-vindo|Bem-vinda}} de volta!"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.65.text"
msgid "What'll it be today?"
msgstr "O que vai ser hoje?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.66.menu"
msgid "What would you like to order?"
msgstr "O que você vai querer?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.67.menu"
msgid "Would you like a drink or something else?"
msgstr "Vai uma bebida ou outra coisa?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.68.menu"
msgid "Go on..."
msgstr "Continue..."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.69.text"
msgid "I haven't received any mash from him\\,\\, for a long time.\\,\\, I have tried to contact him but to no avail."
msgstr "Faz tempo\\,\\, que não recebo garapa dele.\\,\\, Tentei entrar em contato, mas não adiantou."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.70.text"
msgid "Yeah...\\,\\, he got that name after...\\,\\, when he was making some mushroom mash.\\,\\, Someone mashed his head with a hammer."
msgstr "É...\\,\\, ele ganhou esse nome depois que...\\,\\, quando estava fazendo garapa de cogumelo.\\,\\, Alguém esmagou a cabeça dele com um martelo."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.71.text"
msgid "He lives in an apartment in Deekula B.\\,\\,\\, Unfortunately, I don't know the exact address."
msgstr "Ele mora num apartamento no Deekula B.\\,\\,\\, Infelizmente, não sei o endereço exato."

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.72.text"
msgid "I talked to Max"
msgstr "Falei com o Max"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.73.text"
msgid "Doesn't look like it"
msgstr "Não parece"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.76.text"
msgid "Nope. Where is my reward?"
msgstr "Não. Cadê a minha recompensa?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.78.text"
msgid "Oh crap!\\,\\,\\, Where do I get my mash now?"
msgstr "Ah, merda!\\,\\,\\, De onde eu vou tirar garapa agora?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.79.text"
msgid "Maybe I could help you with that?"
msgstr "Talvez eu possa te ajudar com isso?"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.80.text"
msgid "Yes!\\,\\, Yes!\\,\\, That\\, sounds great!\\,\\,\\, I'm going to pay you the market price for any mash\\, you manage to bring me!"
msgstr "Sim!\\,\\, Sim!\\,\\, Isso\\, é ótimo!\\,\\,\\, Vou te pagar o preço de mercado por qualquer garapa\\, que você conseguir me trazer!"

#: Tenement/Speakeasy/Pentti Penttilä
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.33.81.text"
msgid "Damn!\\,\\,\\, I'll probably have to start to...\\,\\,\\, make some fecal kilju now...\\,\\, my customers are not going to like it!"
