#: Tunnels/News: Red Mushroom Body
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.161.5.text"
msgid "Speculation has been running rampant on social media\\,\\,, with various theories\\,\\, emerging about the origin\\, and nature of these mysterious mushrooms."
msgstr "As especulações correm soltas nas redes sociais\\,\\,, com várias teorias\\,\\, surgindo sobre a origem\\, e a natureza desses cogumelos misteriosos."

#: Tunnels/News: Red Mushroom Body
#, fuzzy
