#: Bazaar/Industrial/Tor Bergstahl
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.340.13.text"
msgid "This building was built on\\, top of a\\, hastily covered\\, SOMC\\, mineshaft\\, and its\\, associated ventilation shaft."
msgstr "Este prédio foi construído em\\, cima de um\\, poço de mina da SOMC\\, tapado às pressas\\,, e do\\, poço de ventilação ligado a ele."

#: Bazaar/Industrial/Tor Bergstahl
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.340.14.text"
msgid "In fact\\,, half of the\\, Obenseuer district\\, used to be\\, active\\, mining grounds\\, until\\, operations were\\, halted\\, and the area was\\, rezoned for\\, residential use\\, sometime in the\\, '70s."
