#: Bazaar/Industrial/Tor Bergstahl
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.340.15.text"
msgid "SOMC left behind\\, significant deposits\\, despite ceasing all\\, activity in the\\, area.\\,\\, They're still\\, mining the much\\, larger vein\\, northeast of here."
