#: Bazaar/Industrial/Tor Bergstahl
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.340.17.text"
msgid "If you've been to the\\, mines\\,, you've probably seen the\\, big chasm.\\,\\, That\\, chasm is\\, part of the\\, major vein\\, being mined by\\, SOMC.\\,\\,\\, All the\\, smaller side deposits were\\, left for us."
msgstr "Se você já esteve nas\\, minas\\,, deve ter visto o\\, grande abismo.\\,\\, Aquele\\, abismo faz\\, parte do\\, veio principal\\, que a SOMC\\, explora.\\,\\,\\, Todas as\\, jazidas laterais menores\\, ficaram pra nós."

#: Bazaar/Industrial/Tor Bergstahl
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.340.18.text"
msgid "Back to the topic.\\,\\, This building was never\\, fully finished\\,\\, because it\\, failed inspections\\, due to\\, ground stability issues\\, and\\, contaminated soil.\\,\\,\\, There are\\, many\\, unfinished buildings nearby\\, that suffered\\, the same fate."
