#: Bazaar/Industrial/Tor Bergstahl
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.340.19.text"
msgid "Since the building was never\\, approved for\\, human habitation\\,\\,, locals started\\, setting up\\, businesses\\, and workshops inside it."
