#: Bazaar/Industrial/Tor Bergstahl
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.340.22.text"
msgid "Osmo agreed to\\, let us proceed on the condition\\, that we confine our\\, mining operations to the\\, existing tunnel network\\, and\\,\\,, most importantly\\,, maintain the old tunnels to\\, prevent any\\, future cave-ins."
