msgid "Röh?\\,\\, That was\\, a one-time\\, opportunity\\,\\,, [lua(Actor[\"Player\"].AgeName)].\\,\\,\\, It's full price\\, or\\, nothing now."
msgstr "Röh?\\,\\, Aquela foi\\, uma oportunidade\\, única\\,\\,, [lua(Actor[\"Player\"].AgeName)].\\,\\,\\, Agora é preço cheio\\, ou\\, nada."

#: Phone/Utility/NotAnswering
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.366.1.text"
msgid "The number you dialed is busy at the moment, try again later."
msgstr "O número que você discou está ocupado no momento, tente novamente mais tarde."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.2.text"
msgid "Sit down\\,\\,, lad\\,, and\\, you'll hear\\, an unbelievably true story."
msgstr "Senta aí\\,\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}\\,, e\\, você vai ouvir\\, uma história inacreditavelmente verdadeira."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.3.text"
msgid "So...\\,\\, first\\,, have a sip of my\\, moonshine."
msgstr "Então...\\,\\, primeiro\\,, toma um gole da minha\\, cachaça."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.4.text"
msgid "(Drink)"
msgstr "(Beber)"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.5.text"
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "Não, valeu"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.6.text"
msgid "Came here for some\\, moonshine?\\,\\,\\, I always\\, have some on hand!"
msgstr "Veio atrás de\\, cachaça?\\,\\,\\, Eu sempre\\, tenho um pouco à mão!"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.8.text"
msgid "Yes (Drink)"
msgstr "Sim (Beber)"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.9.text"
msgid "That's the spirit\\,, lad!\\,\\,\\, Anyway..."
msgstr "É assim que se fala\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}!\\,\\,\\, Enfim..."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.10.text"
msgid "It's good\\,\\,, isn't it?"
msgstr "É boa\\,\\,, né?"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.11.text"
msgid "I used to work at the\\, Stalburg\\, Nuclear Power Plant\\,\\,, not\\, far from here.\\,\\,\\, You've probably heard about\\, what happened there\\, around\\,\\, ten years ago\\,, lad?"
msgstr "Eu trabalhava na\\, Usina\\, Nuclear de Stalburg\\,\\,, não\\, muito longe daqui.\\,\\,\\, Você deve ter ouvido falar\\, do que aconteceu lá\\, uns\\,\\, dez anos atrás\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}?"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.12.text"
msgid "Yeah, I remember the news"
msgstr "É, lembro das notícias"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.13.text"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "O quê?"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.14.text"
msgid "They\\, didn't tell you everything\\,, lad.\\,\\,\\, Not\\, even\\, half of it."
msgstr "Não te contaram tudo\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}.\\,\\,\\, Nem\\, a\\, metade."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.15.text"
msgid "So\\,, lad\\,\\,, there was\\, an accident on\\, August 9th\\,, 2016.\\,\\,\\, On that\\, fateful day...\\,\\, or\\, night\\,, in fact...\\,\\, I was on\\, operating duty\\, at one of the reactors."
msgstr "Pois bem\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}\\,\\,, houve\\, um acidente em\\, 9 de agosto\\,, de 2016.\\,\\,\\, Naquele\\, dia fatídico...\\,\\, ou\\, melhor\\,, naquela noite...\\,\\, eu estava de\\, plantão na operação\\, de um dos reatores."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.16.text"
msgid "The day before had been\\, very\\, eventful in the city.\\,\\,\\, Riots\\,, protests\\,, and\\, all kinds of\\, disorder\\, during the\\, elections.\\,\\,\\, On\\, top of that\\,, lad\\,, the city had been\\, ravaged by\\, power cuts\\, and\\, structural failures."
msgstr "O dia anterior tinha sido\\, muito\\, agitado na cidade.\\,\\,\\, Tumultos\\,, protestos\\,, e\\, todo tipo de\\, desordem\\, durante as\\, eleições.\\,\\,\\, Pra\\, piorar\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}\\,, a cidade vinha sendo\\, castigada por\\, apagões\\, e\\, falhas estruturais."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.17.text"
msgid "Because of\\, all the disorder\\, going on in the city\\,\\,, our plant was\\, severely understaffed...\\,\\,\\, we barely even\\, had a\\, skeleton crew operating the plant."
msgstr "Por causa de\\, toda a desordem\\, na cidade\\,\\,, a nossa usina estava\\, com muito pouca gente...\\,\\,\\, a gente mal\\, tinha uma\\, equipe mínima operando a usina."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.18.text"
msgid "During the\\, afternoon\\, and\\, early evening\\,\\,, some other\\, power plants\\, dropped off the grid\\,\\,, and\\, we had to\\, rapidly\\, increase our production\\, to keep the grid stable.\\,\\,\\, Then\\,.\\,.\\,.\\, we received\\, a phone call."
msgstr "Durante a\\, tarde\\, e\\, o começo da noite\\,\\,, algumas outras\\, usinas\\, saíram da rede\\,\\,, e\\, a gente teve que\\, aumentar\\, a produção rapidinho\\, pra manter a rede estável.\\,\\,\\, Aí\\,.\\,.\\,.\\, recebemos\\, um telefonema."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.19.text"
msgid "Lad\\,, you need\\, another drink!\\,\\,\\, Have a sip."
msgstr "{{Meu filho|Minha filha}}\\,, você precisa\\, de mais uma dose!\\,\\,\\, Toma um gole."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.20.text"
msgid "(Drink)"
msgstr "(Beber)"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.21.text"
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "Não, valeu"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.23.text"
msgid "So\\,, lad\\,\\,, we received\\, a phone call\\, informing us that\\, the nearby\\, Two Gorges Dam was\\, likely to collapse soon."
msgstr "Pois bem\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}\\,\\,, recebemos\\, um telefonema\\, avisando que\\, a Represa\\, das Duas Gargantas ali perto\\, provavelmente ia ceder logo."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.24.text"
msgid "If you know\\, anything about the\\, local geography\\,, lad\\,\\,, you know that the\\, SNPP is\\, located on\\, a small lake\\, right downstream from the\\, dam.\\,\\,\\, So\\, a dam failure would\\, affect us."
msgstr "Se você conhece\\, um pouco da\\, geografia local\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}\\,\\,, sabe que a\\, UNS fica\\, num\\, laguinho\\, logo abaixo da\\, represa.\\,\\,\\, Então\\, se a represa rompesse\\, a gente ia sentir."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.25.text"
msgid "The dam had\\, already informed us a few hours earlier that\\, they were conducting an\\, extensive release of water\\, to lower the\\, water level in\\, the Lake Stalburg\\, reservoir.\\,\\,\\, Because of that\\,\\,, the water level\\, in our\\, lake\\, had been rising fast."
msgstr "A represa já tinha\\, avisado umas horas antes que\\, estava fazendo uma\\, grande liberação de água\\, pra baixar o\\, nível do\\, reservatório\\, do Lago Stalburg.\\,\\,\\, Por causa disso\\,\\,, o nível da água\\, no nosso\\, lago\\, vinha subindo rápido."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.26.text"
msgid "Everything was\\, fine\\, for a few hours\\,\\,, but\\, then\\,\\,, we received a\\, call from the\\, dam\\, saying they'd lost one of their\\, floodgates\\, and\\, cracks had started appearing in the\\, concrete\\, where the gate once stood."
msgstr "Ficou tudo\\, bem\\, por umas horas\\,\\,, mas\\, aí\\,\\,, recebemos uma\\, ligação da\\, represa\\, dizendo que tinham perdido uma das\\, comportas\\,, e\\, que tinham começado a aparecer rachaduras no\\, concreto\\, onde ficava a comporta."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.27.text"
msgid "And\\,, lad\\,, you know what happened then?\\,\\,\\,\\, The big\\, boss\\, of the entire\\, power plant\\, decided to\\, send almost\\, the entire crew home\\,\\,, leaving only me\\,, the operator of the\\, other reactor\\,, and\\, a couple of technicians."
msgstr "E\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}\\,, sabe o que aconteceu aí?\\,\\,\\,\\, O grande\\, chefe\\, da usina\\, inteira\\, resolveu\\, mandar quase\\, toda a equipe pra casa\\,\\,, deixando só eu\\,, o operador do\\, outro reator\\,, e\\, uns dois técnicos."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.28.text"
msgid "After sending everyone home\\,\\,, he\\, called some\\, engineering company to do\\, a quick safety assessment\\, of the facility.\\,\\,\\, Seriously\\,, lad\\,\\,\\,, what good would some\\, engineers taking photos of\\, exposed rebar\\, and\\, writing a report do?"
msgstr "Depois de mandar todo mundo pra casa\\,\\,, ele\\, chamou uma\\, empresa de engenharia pra fazer\\, uma avaliação rápida de segurança\\, das instalações.\\,\\,\\, Sério\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}\\,\\,\\,, de que adiantariam uns\\, engenheiros tirando foto de\\, vergalhão exposto\\, e\\, escrevendo relatório?"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.29.text"
msgid "Some time after that\\,\\,, we received\\, another call\\, saying that the\\, dam's failure was\\, imminent.\\,\\,\\, I was about to\\, SCRAM the reactor\\,\\,, but\\, the boss told me not to.\\,\\,\\, Apparently\\,, lad\\,, the plant was\\, supposed to be able to handle\\, \"a little flood\"...\\,\\,\\, have another drink!"
msgstr "Um tempo depois\\,\\,, recebemos\\, outra ligação\\, dizendo que o\\, rompimento da represa era\\, iminente.\\,\\,\\, Eu estava prestes a\\, dar SCRAM no reator\\,\\,, mas\\, o chefe me mandou não dar.\\,\\,\\, Pelo jeito\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}\\,, a usina devia\\, aguentar\\, \"uma enchentezinha\"...\\,\\,\\, toma mais uma dose!"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.30.text"
msgid "(Drink)"
msgstr "(Beber)"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.31.text"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr "Não, valeu."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.32.text"
msgid "What does \"SCRAM\" mean?"
msgstr "O que quer dizer “SCRAM”?"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.35.text"
msgid "\"SCRAM\" means\\, shutting down the reactor."
msgstr "\"SCRAM\" quer dizer\\, desligar o reator."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.36.text"
msgid "After midnight\\,\\,, the dam finally buckled\\,\\,, and\\, the plant was hit by\\, a flood wave\\, several meters high.\\,\\,\\, We lost\\, all power\\,\\,, and\\, the backup generators failed to\\, start automatically.\\,\\,\\, Only the\\, unit in the\\, administrative building managed to\\, start\\,\\,, giving us\\, just enough power for\\, the control console."
msgstr "Depois da meia-noite\\,\\,, a represa finalmente cedeu\\,\\,, e\\, a usina foi atingida por\\, uma onda de enchente\\, de vários metros de altura.\\,\\,\\, Perdemos\\, toda a energia\\,\\,, e\\, os geradores reserva não\\, ligaram automaticamente.\\,\\,\\, Só o\\, gerador do\\, prédio administrativo conseguiu\\, ligar\\,\\,, dando\\, energia que mal bastava para\\, o console de controle."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.37.text"
msgid "I did hit the SCRAM...\\,\\,\\, and.\\,.\\,.\\,\\,\\, nothing!"
msgstr "Eu apertei o SCRAM, sim...\\,\\,\\, e.\\,.\\,.\\,\\,\\, nada!"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.38.text"
msgid "After that\\,\\,, I tried to\\, move the rods individually from the\\, console\\,\\,, but\\, that didn't work either.\\,\\,\\, The other\\, reactor managed to shut down correctly."
msgstr "Depois disso\\,\\,, tentei\\, mover as barras uma por uma pelo\\, console\\,\\,, mas\\, também não funcionou.\\,\\,\\, O outro\\, reator conseguiu desligar direitinho."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.39.text"
msgid "We started\\, investigating why\\, the controls weren't responding.\\,\\,\\, Meanwhile\\,\\,, the reactor was still\\, running at full power.\\,\\,\\, With the plant\\, having no power\\,\\,, the coolant pumps\\, weren't running\\,\\,, putting us at\\, risk of a meltdown."
msgstr "A gente começou a\\, investigar por que\\, os controles não respondiam.\\,\\,\\, Enquanto isso\\,\\,, o reator continuava\\, a toda potência.\\,\\,\\, Com a usina\\, sem energia\\,\\,, as bombas de refrigeração\\, não funcionavam\\,\\,, e a gente corria\\, risco de fusão do núcleo."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.40.text"
msgid "At this point\\,\\,, the boss started\\, getting really nervous.\\,\\,\\, He began\\, screaming at us."
msgstr "Nessa hora\\,\\,, o chefe começou a\\, ficar muito nervoso.\\,\\,\\, Começou a\\, gritar com a gente."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.41.text"
msgid "We figured\\, we could try manually starting the\\, secondary backup\\, generators\\, located in the basement\\, of the containment structure.\\,\\,\\, Those\\, should've been\\, unaffected by the flood."
msgstr "A gente pensou\\, em tentar ligar na mão os\\, geradores\\, reserva secundários\\, que ficavam no porão\\, da estrutura de contenção.\\,\\,\\, Esses\\, não deviam ter\\, sido afetados pela enchente."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.42.text"
msgid "We then tried calling back\\, the staff\\, we'd sent home\\,\\,, but\\, alas\\,\\,, they couldn't get back\\, because the flood had cut off\\, all the roads\\, leading here.\\,\\,\\, This\\, calls for a drink!"
msgstr "Aí tentamos chamar de volta\\, o pessoal\\, que tínhamos mandado pra casa\\,\\,, mas\\, infelizmente\\,\\,, eles não conseguiam voltar\\, porque a enchente tinha bloqueado\\, todas as estradas\\, até aqui.\\,\\,\\, Isso\\, pede uma dose!"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.43.text"
msgid "(Drink)"
msgstr "(Beber)"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.44.text"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr "Não, valeu."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.46.text"
msgid "Oh\\, yeah\\,\\,, lad.\\,\\, Good stuff\\,, innit?"
msgstr "Ah\\, é\\,\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}.\\,\\, Coisa boa\\,, né não?"

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.48.text"
msgid "Where was I?\\,\\,\\, Yes...\\,\\, at this point\\,\\,, our\\, boss\\, really began to\\, break down\\, and lose it.\\,\\,\\, He started\\, acting\\, even more irrationally than before."
msgstr "Onde eu estava?\\,\\,\\, Ah, sim...\\,\\, nessa hora\\,\\,, o nosso\\, chefe\\, começou mesmo a\\, desmoronar\\, e perder o controle.\\,\\,\\, Começou a\\, agir\\, de um jeito ainda mais irracional que antes."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.49.text"
msgid "Then\\, we heard a\\, helicopter\\, and saw it landing on\\, the roof\\,\\,, with\\, three lads disembarking.\\,\\,\\, Two of them\\,, a man\\, and\\, a woman\\,, wandered off\\, and immediately\\, got themselves stuck\\, in the coffee room\\,\\,, while\\, an older man made his way into the\\, control room\\, where we were."
msgstr "Aí\\, a gente ouviu um\\, helicóptero\\, e viu ele pousando no\\, telhado\\,\\,, com\\, três sujeitos descendo.\\,\\,\\, Dois deles\\,, um homem\\, e\\, uma mulher\\,, saíram andando\\, e logo\\, ficaram presos\\, na sala do café\\,\\,, enquanto\\, um homem mais velho foi até a\\, sala de controle\\, onde a gente estava."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.50.text"
msgid "This\\, group of fools was from\\, the engineering company\\, the boss had called to\\, survey our\\, plant\\, and cover his ass with paperwork.\\,\\,\\, Well\\,\\,, with the flood\\, already hitting us\\, and\\, the reactor left without cooling\\,\\,, crawling toward\\, a meltdown\\,\\,, there wasn't\\, much for the engineering company to\\, do anymore."
msgstr "Esse\\, bando de tontos era\\, da empresa de engenharia\\, que o chefe tinha chamado pra\\, vistoriar a nossa\\, usina\\, e livrar a cara dele com papelada.\\,\\,\\, Bom\\,\\,, com a enchente\\, já em cima da gente\\, e\\, o reator sem refrigeração\\,\\,, se arrastando rumo a\\, uma fusão\\,\\,, não sobrava\\, muita coisa pra empresa de engenharia\\, fazer."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.51.text"
msgid "The boss had already\\, lost it\\, and pretty much\\, told the concrete photographers\\,\\,, he'd summoned\\,, to pack up their things\\, and go home."
msgstr "O chefe já tinha\\, perdido o juízo\\, e praticamente\\, mandou os fotógrafos de concreto\\,\\,, que ele mesmo chamou\\,, juntarem as coisas\\, e irem pra casa."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.53.text"
msgid "The older lad\\,, their boss\\,, disagreed\\, and tried to\\, persuade my boss to continue.\\,\\,\\, My boss told\\, the boat lad to make his way to\\, the backup generators\\, and start them."
msgstr "O mais velho\\,, o chefe deles\\,, discordou\\, e tentou\\, convencer o meu chefe a continuar.\\,\\,\\, O meu chefe mandou\\, o rapaz do barco ir até\\, os geradores reserva\\, e ligar eles."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.54.text"
msgid "Lad\\,\\,, the boat lad was\\, absolutely out of his mind.\\,\\,\\, He did some\\, hazardous acrobatics through the\\, flooded turbine hall to\\, reach the backup generators.\\,\\,\\, Just like before\\,, the backup generators failed to\\, start.\\,\\, The boss told him to go to\\, the basement of the\\, containment building\\,\\,, where the manually operated\\, secondary backup generators were."
msgstr "{{Meu filho|Minha filha}}\\,\\,, o rapaz do barco era\\, completamente doido.\\,\\,\\, Ele fez umas\\, acrobacias perigosas pelo\\, salão das turbinas alagado pra\\, chegar aos geradores reserva.\\,\\,\\, Igual a antes\\,, os geradores reserva não\\, ligaram.\\,\\, O chefe mandou ele ir até\\, o porão do\\, prédio de contenção\\,\\,, onde ficavam os\\, geradores reserva secundários manuais."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.55.text"
msgid "That lad did make it there\\,\\,, and\\, soon we saw on the\\, control panel that\\, the reactor building had power.\\,\\,\\, But\\, we still weren't able to\\, operate the pumps\\, or\\, the reactor remotely.\\,\\,\\, The only way was to\\, operate them\\, manually\\,, and\\, the reactor had been running for\\, hours without cooling.\\,\\,\\, Radiation levels were\\, already rising."
msgstr "O rapaz conseguiu chegar lá\\,\\,, e\\, logo a gente viu no\\, painel de controle que\\, o prédio do reator tinha energia.\\,\\,\\, Mas\\, a gente ainda não conseguia\\, operar as bombas\\, nem\\, o reator à distância.\\,\\,\\, O único jeito era\\, operar tudo\\, na mão\\,, e\\, o reator estava funcionando havia\\, horas sem refrigeração.\\,\\,\\, Os níveis de radiação já\\, estavam subindo."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.56.text"
msgid "That mad lad agreed to\\, enter the reactor hall to\\, start the pumps.\\,\\,\\, He\\, probably received one hell of\\, a dose.\\,\\, I don't know what happened after\\, the boat lad entered the reactor hall\\,.\\,.\\,.\\,\\, my boss ordered me to leave.\\,\\, Don't know why.\\,\\,\\, Something\\, fishy was going on."
msgstr "Aquele doido topou\\, entrar no salão do reator pra\\, ligar as bombas.\\,\\,\\, Ele\\, deve ter levado uma baita\\, dose.\\,\\, Não sei o que aconteceu depois que\\, o rapaz do barco entrou no salão do reator\\,.\\,.\\,.\\,\\, o meu chefe me mandou sair.\\,\\, Não sei por quê.\\,\\,\\, Tinha\\, alguma coisa muito estranha acontecendo."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.57.text"
msgid "Some time after that\\,\\,, I saw the helicopter\\, fly over to the reactor roof\\,\\,, pick up the crazy boat lad\\,, and\\, fly off.\\,\\,\\, Don't know if he\\, succeeded\\, or not."
msgstr "Um tempo depois\\,\\,, eu vi o helicóptero\\, voar até o telhado do reator\\,\\,, pegar o doido do barco\\,, e\\, ir embora.\\,\\,\\, Não sei se ele\\, conseguiu\\, ou não."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.58.text"
msgid "I read in the reports that\\, the power plant was forced to\\, vent radioactive steam\\, into the atmosphere\\, and\\, that the reactor suffered\\, a great deal of damage\\,\\,, including\\, at least a partial meltdown\\, and\\, damaged fuel rods.\\,\\,\\, I\\, never received\\, the full detailed reports\\,, since\\, the whole incident was\\, blamed on me\\, and\\, I was fired\\, before the investigation was fully concluded."
msgstr "Li nos relatórios que\\, a usina foi obrigada a\\, liberar vapor radioativo\\, na atmosfera\\, e\\, que o reator sofreu\\, muitos danos\\,\\,, incluindo\\, pelo menos uma fusão parcial\\, e\\, barras de combustível danificadas.\\,\\,\\, Eu\\, nunca recebi\\, os relatórios completos\\,, já que\\, o incidente todo\\, foi jogado nas minhas costas\\, e\\, eu fui demitido\\, antes de a investigação terminar."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.59.text"
msgid "Emergency units\\,, followed by\\, military engineers\\,, arrived early in the morning\\,, once\\, the floodwaters had receded\\, just enough for the\\, roads to be usable.\\,\\,\\, After them\\,, more\\, and\\, more workers began arriving\\,\\,, and\\, I was finally able to\\, return home\\, on one of their buses."
msgstr "As equipes de emergência\\,, seguidas pelos\\, engenheiros do exército\\,, chegaram de manhã cedo\\,, assim que\\, a água da enchente baixou\\, o suficiente pra\\, dar pra usar as estradas.\\,\\,\\, Depois deles\\,, cada vez\\, mais\\, trabalhadores foram chegando\\,\\,, e\\, eu finalmente consegui\\, voltar pra casa\\, num dos ônibus deles."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.60.text"
msgid "My boss managed to\\, keep his job\\,\\,, while\\, the whole thing was actually\\, his fault.\\,\\,\\, He\\, really does have some\\, powerful friends..."
msgstr "O meu chefe conseguiu\\, manter o emprego\\,\\,, sendo que\\, a culpa toda era\\, dele.\\,\\,\\, Ele\\, tem mesmo uns\\, amigos poderosos..."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.61.text"
msgid "Anyway\\,, lad\\,, thanks for\\, listening to the truth.\\,\\,\\, Take this."
msgstr "Enfim\\,, {{meu filho|minha filha}}\\,, obrigado por\\, ouvir a verdade.\\,\\,\\, Toma isto."

#: Bazaar/Murju/Anatoli Mustaruoho
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.367.62.text"
msgid "He was\\, clearly trying to\\, save his ass\\, by creating a paper trail to\\, prove that\\, the plant was up to\\, code."
