#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.426.9.text"
msgid "Mailanen swore\\, it was everything\\,\\,, but...\\, that can't be true."
msgstr "O Mailanen jurou\\, que era tudo\\,\\,, mas...\\, não pode ser verdade."

#: Bazaar/Casino/Casper Colikke Mailanen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.426.10.text"
