#: Bazaar/Casino/Casper Colikke Mailanen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.426.21.text"
msgid "Sit\\, right there...\\,\\, I'll be\\, back in\\, ten minutes.\\,\\, Don't\\, touch anything."
