#: Bazaar/Casino/Casper Colikke Mailanen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.426.24.text"
msgid "Ah\\,\\,, time is\\, money\\,\\,, isn't it?"
msgstr "Ah\\,\\,, tempo é\\, dinheiro\\,\\,, não é?"

#: Bazaar/Casino/Casper Colikke Mailanen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.426.25.text"
