#: Bazaar/Casino/Casper Colikke Mailanen
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "dlg.426.29.text"
msgid "I'll\\, ask you one last time...\\,\\, are you sure\\, you want to\\, walk away?\\,\\, I'm offering\\, good money."
